      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm currently drafting a section for my thesis on the Maillard reaction. Could you provide a detailed breakdown of the specific roles that amino acids and reducing sugars play in the initial stages of the reaction? I'm also particularly interested in how fluctuations in pH levels—specifically moving from an acidic to an alkaline environment—impact the reaction rate and the resulting flavor profile in protein-heavy substrates.",
