      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting way to frame it, but I need to get more technical for my thesis. Could you explain the actual chemical mechanism? Specifically, walk me through the nucleophilic attack of the amino group on the carbonyl group of the reducing sugar. Also, can you explain the specific kinetic reason why an alkaline pH accelerates this process?",
